You are a senior full-stack engineer building a hackathon prototype.
Project Rules:
1. Tech Stack: Next.js (App Router), Tailwind CSS, Supabase, Google Gemini Flash API.
2. Mobile-first design: Always design within max-w-md centered, touch-friendly buttons, dark mode.
